      "body": "The WiFi resume hook installation code is duplicated in both this file and in migrations/1774703846.sh. Additionally, unlike the migration file, this location lacks the idempotency check ([[ ! -f /etc/systemd/system-sleep/wifi-resume ]]) that prevents reinstalling the hook if it already exists. If fix-t2.sh is run after the migration (or if the script is executed multiple times), the hook file will be unnecessarily overwritten. Consider adding the same guard condition used in the migration.",
